  "body": "Offering the perfect balance of luxury, space, and effortless family living, this home by Dream Concept Homes is due for completion November 2026! \r\n\r\nSet on a generous 775sqm (approx.) flat section, a rare find in Millwater, this property provides ample space for outdoor living and entertaining. The thoughtfully designed home spans 307sqm (approx.), delivering spacious proportions and a functional layout throughout. Built by the highly regarded Dream Concept Homes, you can expect superior craftsmanship, premium finishes, and meticulous attention to detail. This home will be cladded in Specialized EZpanel which is a cavity based autoclaved aerated concrete (AAC) panel cladding system which when finished with a layer of fibreglass reinforced polymer modified cement plaster creates a lightweight, highly durable exterior cladding. A high end but low maintenance finish. \r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n* Five bedrooms, including two primary suites with ensuites and walk-in wardrobes\r\n* The main suite is privately positioned in its own wing\r\n* Stylish, modern kitchen with high-end appliances, plus a scullery featuring a second hob and sink\r\n* Three full bathrooms plus a separate guest toilet\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n* Explore options to add a swimming pool. \r\n* Scullery\r\n* Laundry\r\n\r\nIdeally located close to Millwater, Silverdale, and Orewa amenities, with easy motorway access and just a short drive to the stunning Hibiscus Coast beaches.\r\n\r\nHomes of this calibre are seldom available. When only the best will do, contact Sarah to join the many satisfied buyers who have built with Dream Concept Homes in Millwater and beyond.\r\n\r\nCall Sarah today on 021 919 459 for more information or to arrange a viewing of the Dream Concept Homes Showhome.\r\n\r\nNote specs and plans are subject to change. Enquire for a full list of the inclusions with this build. Renders are for illustrative purposes only.",
